  "body": "What happens: `camcraft-ui` does not compile on `main` at `57f2ffbbf`. The compiler gives E0004 in `crates/ui/src/machine_modes.rs`, function `short_caption`: the `match` has no arm for `MachineKind::Waterjet`.\n\nCause: the merges of PR #2001 (waterjet machine kinds, `8459f4375`) and PR #1753 (sinker EDM template, `70da5191b`) do not conflict as text, but together they leave the `match` incomplete.\n\nFound by: a refresh agent that built `camcraft-ui` on the merge of `main`.\n\nDone means:\n- `cargo check -p camcraft-ui --all-targets` is clean on `main`.\n- The `match` in `short_caption` has an arm for each `MachineKind`, with no wildcard arm, so that the compiler finds the next new kind.\n- A test asserts a caption for each machine kind.\n",
